rchived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"ffddff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-07-24T20:32:59Z","updated_at":"2025-07-25T17:29:16Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.4.1 and 006e3f26b9 4.5-dev\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Godot 4.5-beta - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Radeon 890M, driver 25.6.1\n\n### Issue description\n\n<img width=\"1123\" height=\"781\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cb7b2a9b-cc18-4823-9dcc-6b4e0519af4b\" />\n\nIf you can reproduce this bug, you should see temporally incoherent shadows with a big split in the middle of the screen. Move the camera to see the shadows dance about.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nMake a really big ground plane to exacerbate the issue. Add a directional light and enable shadows. Or, open my attached minimal reproduction project and shadow-flicker.tscn.\n\nI think the issue is present on all rendering backends. DX12 forward+ crashed in my dev build but the issue was present in DX12 forward+ and GLES in 4.4.1. The issue is also present on Linux in 4.4.1 on Vulkan forward+.\n\nMy friend on Nvidia wasn't able to reproduce the issue. It may be AMD-specific. I'm in the middle of a game jam right now so I have limited time to help resolve this issue at the moment.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[shadow-flicker.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21418851/shadow-flicker.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108951/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108951/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}